DTEND:20251018T201500Z
DTSTAMP:20251018T180000Z
UID:OixUmqKRD3
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 120 mins (2h00m)\n\nPresented by Glass Art Society &
  REFRACT: The Seattle Glass Experience Enjoy the intersection of glass and
  film during REFRACT: The Seattle Glass Experience showing of the Glass Ar
 t Society Annual Film Festival! This juried festival involves an in-person
  screening at their Annual GAS Conference\, as well as a virtual screening
  in the winter. The call for Film Festival entries typically goes out in N
 ovember of each year. Learn more.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theate
 rs/glass-art-society-film-festival\n\nEstimated start: 11:15
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Rocky Horror Picture Show
DTSTART:20251026T023000Z
DTEND:20251026T050500Z
DTSTAMP:20251026T023000Z
UID:tegjVaIvKL
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 138 mins (2h18m)\n\nStep into the time warp like you
 ’ve never seen it before. This Halloween season\, Seattle artists are br
 inging The Rocky Horror Picture Show to life with a dazzling twist—pole\
 , burlesque\, and drag collide with the cult classic film in a chaotic\, c
 ampy\, and deliciously risqué spectacle. As the movie plays\, performers 
 will leap off the screen (sometimes literally)\, battling the film itself 
 for your attention. Expect glitter\, fishnets\, corsets\, and wild surpris
 es around every corner. Whether you’re a seasoned creature of the night 
 or a Rocky virgin\, you’ll be swept into an evening of sin\, seduction\,
  and absolute pleasure. TICKET PRICING:Early Bird (through Oct 10) - $37.5
 0 ($35 SIFF Members)General (starting Oct 10) - $40 ($35 SIFF Members)Day-
 Of Show - $45 ($35 SIFF Members)\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theater
 s/rocky-horror-pole-show\n\nEstimated start: 19:45
LOCATION:SIFF Film Center\, 305 Harrison Street
END:VEVENT
